sequenceDiagram
    participant PT as PyTorchJob
    participant Kube as Kubelet
    participant CSI as WEKA CSI Driver
    participant Eth as SONiC 100GbE Switch
    participant NVMe as WEKA Storage Appliance

    PT->>Kube: Pod scheduled, requires 50TB dataset
    Kube->>CSI: NodePublishVolume request
    CSI->>NVMe: API Call: Create/Expose Volume
    NVMe-->>CSI: Volume Ready
    CSI->>Kube: Mount volume locally (RoCEv2 backend)
    Kube->>PT: Start Container with mounted hostPath
    PT->>NVMe: Read Training Data (Batch 1)
    Note over PT, NVMe: Traffic flows directly over 100GbE bypassing CPU bottleneck
    NVMe-->>Eth: 100GbE RoCEv2 packets
    Eth-->>PT: Data loaded into RAM/VRAM
